{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2558/content00896?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong>#<span style=\"color: #c91623; text-decoration: underline;\">一体化</span>供应链-标准解决方案</strong></em></span></a> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">行业痛点与方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">行业痛点</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;1 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>园区整体运营效率低下包括：沟通效率，仍使用传统的信息媒介；</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">运作效率，无严格组织有序的多点提货；</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">交接效率，复杂的纸质单据</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;2 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>各作业节点无法可视化包括：园区月台实况不直观，需要人工现场查看并分配；</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">备货情况&amp;月台装卸速度/完成情况不可视提货等待时间不可视，造成园外拥堵</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;3 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>物业安防管理成本高效率低，包括：人员/车辆入园效率低，需要人工登记，费时费力；</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">物流园区设备检测/维保无预见性；消防的要求越来越高；园区能源管控非智能</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;1 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过无人化智能安检，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">实现入园人车认证，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">不用停车</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过智能车辆调度，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">实现车辆零等待</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过月台导引、月台可视化缩短提卸货时间</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;4 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过车辆在途可视化，准确知道车辆到达时间</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;5 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过数据可视化进行运营管控</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #2576e8; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">智能物流园区解决方案</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">面向政府产业园区和企业物流园区，利用5G、物联网、人工智能、区块链等关键技术打造高智能、自决策、低碳化的智能物流园区平台，实现园区的高效运营和绿色可持续发展为政府和企业客户创造价值；基于物流场景特点和需求，打造可标准化复制的软硬件自研产品，集成经营、交易、物业、可视化等物流园区相关需求isv能力，扩充产品版图，满足多元需求。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/181616/11/31711/286984/63ef2186F198c5bfa/f74d76af0aca8474.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">成功案例</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">某全球头部快消企业物流园区</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">客户是世界领先的快消品生产企业之一，其园区存在二大核心痛点：协同效率低、安防管理难、数据不可视。客户借力数字场站、智能物业及数字化看板等产品，极大地提升了多方协同效率和安防管理质量，全面实现了园区的数字化生产与运营。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/136570/23/33755/308243/63ef2197F984cee8d/e9b141f0bc2c3b37.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/211205/19/30024/43354/63f2db22F2ff76325/353ccc23827231ad.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01057", "contentTitle": "软件产品-京东物流科技 5G智能物流园区", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1676426337000, "id": 2853, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/172174/20/28962/14127/63ef4e4cF5d134085/3f4b14f114ef02af.png", "updateTime": 1676862135000}}